{"unit_id":"melo7up__dsh-git-change#card-zh","repo":"melo7up/dsh-git-change","commit":"39a3392112218a7fe0837d7fec83e04820454f9a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-change 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 Git 状态插件，会在对话输入框工具栏、模型选择器旁显示分支角标。它通过客户端插槽呈现图标，并调用 host RPC 读取当前会话工作目录的 Git 状态。悬停可查看分支名、变更文件数以及新增和删除行数；统计涵盖未推送的本分支提交、暂存与未暂存改动及未跟踪文件。适合在 DSH 中快速查看当前项目改动的人；需要本机安装 Git，不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:216-232","index.js:38-64","git.js:243-281"]}
{"unit_id":"melo7up__dsh-git-change#card-en","repo":"melo7up/dsh-git-change","commit":"39a3392112218a7fe0837d7fec83e04820454f9a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-git-change adds a Git branch badge to the DSH Web composer. It reads the active session directory through host RPC. Hover to see the branch, changed files, and added or deleted lines from unpushed commits, worktree edits, and untracked files. Requires local Git; no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:216-232","index.js:38-64","git.js:243-281"]}
